@title Castlevania - Circle of the Moon (USA)
@file Castlevania - Circle of the Moon (U) [!].gba
@game AAME
@chip SRAM
@status wip: stops in the opening cutscene (Dracula's "you sealed me" line); mashing A on through the dialog (about 1,700 more frames) drops Nathan into the catacombs with control, but the game writes only its "DRACULA AGB" header at boot and nothing at name entry, so the first real save needs Nathan walked to the first save room. Explored live: from the landing spot RIGHT leads down a shaft of wooden ledges to a wall, the way on is left past a skeleton. A human should record: DATA SELECT, empty file, name AA, the opening dialog, walk to the first save room and touch the save statue, quit after the save message; [load]: DATA SELECT shows the file, pick it to resume in the save room.

# Title skip -> DATA SELECT -> empty file -> name AA -> opening scroll and the
# Dracula cutscene.

[new]
wait 600
press START
until text "Game" timeout=600 every=10
wait 60
checkpoint main_menu compare=text
press A
until text "Choose" timeout=300 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint data_select window=10
press A
until text "ENTRY" timeout=300 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint name_entry window=10
press A after=20
press A after=20
press START after=30
checkpoint name_aa window=10
press A
until text "1830" timeout=900 every=10
checkpoint intro_scroll compare=text
mash A until text "sealed" timeout=6000 every=20
checkpoint dracula compare=text
